# charon integration step 33 after 546078ea5d: commit fa444321bd2ffcb265ff32b4eb2bf2fb67e676bb
# first parent d48a61a9921d7201a3dd5a28694be465183f0ea5
# series charon: patch -p1 in charon/ of the upstream source
#
# charon: translate doc comments only with --doc-comments
#
# DocComment attributes carry no semantics and took 6% of chelis-deep's llbc (11 MB) and 12% of
# chelis-pred's. Aeneas does not read them (the doc comments of its generated code are its own). They
# are now translated only with the new --doc-comments option; generate-ml passes it, since the OCaml
# doc comments are generated from the Rust ones.

